♪ Apple apple big and red / Apple apple overhead / Crunch it up from core to top / An apple snack that just won't stop!

42
00:04:26,880 --> 00:04:40,080
♪ A is amazing A is the best / A is the letter we love the most / Sing it with me — A A A! / A words are awesome every day!

43
00:04:40,080 --> 00:04:57,780
♪ Airplane airplane in the sky / Airplane airplane flying high / Spreading wings and zooming free / An airplane goes where it wants to be!

44
00:04:57,780 --> 00:05:10,280
♪ A is amazing A is the best / A is the letter we love the most / Sing it with me — A A A! / A words are awesome every day!

45
00:05:10,280 --> 00:05:24,780
♪ Apple makes our tummies glad! / Airplane is the best we've had! / A words make the whole day bright / A words always feel just right!

46
00:05:24,780 --> 00:05:37,780
♪ A is amazing A is the best / A is the letter we love the most / Sing it with me — A A A! / A words are awesome every day!

47
00:05:37,780 --> 00:05:47,110
♪ Great job friends you did it today! / We learned our A words — hip hip hooray! / See you next time — bye bye bye!

48
00:05:47,110 --> 00:05:48,238
Sunny: We made an A!

49
00:05:52,610 --> 00:05:54,218
Crew: We practiced all day!

50
00:05:58,110 --> 00:05:59,502
Sunny: We did it!

51
00:06:03,610 --> 00:06:05,434
Sunny: Pipa, how do you feel?

52
00:06:07,110 --> 00:06:08,110
Pipa: Proud!

53
00:06:10,610 --> 00:06:12,434
Pipa: Clapping my name helped.

54
00:06:14,610 --> 00:06:16,026
Pipa: Our names are amazing!

55
00:06:20,110 --> 00:06:22,294
Ava: You were all amazing today!

56
00:06:24,610 --> 00:06:25,738
Sunny: Your turn at home:

57
00:06:28,410 --> 00:06:30,594
Sunny: Clap your name! Make an A!

58
00:06:33,910 --> 00:06:37,150
Sunny: Every crew needs YOU... yes, YOU.

59
00:06:38,910 --> 00:06:40,374
Sunny: Bye, amazing friends!

